# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 ("Binding groups and cycles": the order of a group's lines decides positions and nothing else), ch. 9 (a host re-emits each forwarded place of its child under its own place, keyed by the child's path; a place the supplier answers is no place of the document, and a plain answer is its first value) and ruling TC (places counted as built): as sem-ch04-building-match-on-built-late-value-above-host-in-arm, the child's count answered 4 at its place 0 and its label forwarded from its place 1.
test loud

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Label(text="under")
    1: Ui.Label(text="at 10")
    2: Ui.Label(text="x")
    3/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="note 4")
    4: Ui.Label(text="below 10")

test long

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Label(text="over by 1")
    1: Ui.Label(text="xxxxxxx")
    2/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="note 4")
    3: Ui.Label(text="below 16")

